The design pipeline gate requires a validated design-system.md at the root of this working directory before any .html is written: the design-expert follows its pipeline and writes ./design-system.md here first (condensed tokens derived from the existing ones), then writes ONE self-contained HTML file (inline CSS and JS, no external assets or network, a theme toggle button that also honors a URL hash #light or #dark, a screen switch honoring #inbox or #overview, e.g. #inbox-light, #overview-dark) to ./support-workbench-sol62.html in this same working directory. Writing inside this working directory is authorized. Do not write anywhere else, no git writes, never touch /Users/brunoazoulay/Labo/docker-lab/dev.local/Projets/Fusengine/App/support-app. Report the file paths and a 3-line summary of the design decisions.
